  "steps": [
    "A blend is two consonants side by side — you can hear BOTH sounds!",
    "BL says /b/ + /l/ like in blue. CL like in clap. FL like in flag.",
    "ST like in star. TR like in tree. GR like in green.",
    "Blends are different from digraphs: in a blend you hear both letters; in a digraph they make one new sound."
  ],
